---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import { finished } from '../utils/books';

const all = await getCollection('books');
const BASE = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="匯出">
  <div class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-medium text-stone-800">匯出</h1>
    <span class="flex-1 border-t border-stone-200" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>

  <article class="max-w-2xl rounded-2xl border border-stone-200/80 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
    <p class="text-stone-700">
      所有書籍資料以 <strong>JSON</strong> 格式提供下載,方便備份或遷移到其他平台。
    </p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-stone-500">
      目前共收錄 {all.length} 本書(其中 {finished(all).length} 本已讀)。
    </p>

    <a
      href={`${BASE}export/books.json`}
      download="books.json"
      class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-stone-800 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow transition hover:bg-stone-700"
    >
      ⬇️ 下載 books.json
    </a>

    <div class="mt-8 border-t border-stone-100 pt-5 text-sm text-stone-500">
      每本書對應的 Markdown 檔,也直接保存在
      <code class="rounded bg-stone-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-stone-600">src/content/books/</code>
      目錄中,本身就是最完整的備份。
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
